#: assets/src/js/admin/components/SettingsPanel.js:78
msgid "Settings saved."
msgstr "Ajustes guardados."

#: assets/src/js/admin/components/SettingsPanel.js:85
msgid "Settings could not be saved."
msgstr "No se han podido guardar los ajustes."

#: assets/src/js/admin/components/SettingsPanel.js:101
msgid ""
"Are you sure you want to delete all recorded views? This action cannot be "
"undone."
msgstr ""
"¿Seguro que quieres eliminar todas las vistas registradas? Esta acción no se"
" puede deshacer."

#: assets/src/js/admin/components/SettingsPanel.js:119
msgid "All recorded views have been deleted."
msgstr "Se han eliminado todas las vistas registradas."

#: assets/src/js/admin/components/SettingsPanel.js:129
msgid "Data could not be deleted."
msgstr "No se han podido eliminar los datos."

#: assets/src/js/admin/components/SettingsPanel.js:144
msgid "What gets counted"
msgstr "Qué se cuenta"

#: assets/src/js/admin/components/SettingsPanel.js:145
msgid "Content types and visitors that generate a view."
msgstr "Tipos de contenido y visitantes que generan una vista."

#: assets/src/js/admin/components/SettingsPanel.js:152
msgid "Content types"
msgstr "Tipos de contenido"

#: assets/src/js/admin/components/SettingsPanel.js:178
msgid ""
"Unchecking a content type stops counting, but does not delete views already "
"recorded. Checking it again resumes counting on top of the existing total."
msgstr ""
"Desmarcar un tipo de contenido detiene el conteo, pero no borra las visitas "
"ya registradas. Volver a marcarlo reanuda el conteo sobre el total "
"existente."

#: assets/src/js/admin/components/SettingsPanel.js:187
msgid "Excluded roles"
msgstr "Roles excluidos"

#: assets/src/js/admin/components/SettingsPanel.js:211
msgid ""
"Logged-in users with one of these roles do not generate views when viewing "
"their own content."
msgstr ""
"Los usuarios logados con uno de estos roles no generan visitas al ver sus "
"propios contenidos."

#: assets/src/js/admin/components/SettingsPanel.js:228
msgid "Do not count views from known bot user agents."
msgstr "No contar visitas de user-agents de bots conocidos."

#: assets/src/js/admin/components/SettingsPanel.js:234
msgid "Includes, among others:"
msgstr "Incluye, entre otros:"

#: assets/src/js/admin/components/SettingsPanel.js:247
msgid "AI & privacy"
msgstr "IA y privacidad"

#: assets/src/js/admin/components/SettingsPanel.js:248
msgid "AI bot tracking and visitor privacy signals."
msgstr "Rastreo de bots de IA y señales de privacidad del visitante."

#: assets/src/js/admin/components/SettingsPanel.js:270
msgid ""
"Count visits from known AI bots (GPTBot, ClaudeBot, PerplexityBot, etc.) in "
"their own table, separate from human visitor counts."
msgstr ""
"Contar las visitas de bots de IA conocidos (GPTBot, ClaudeBot, "
"PerplexityBot, etc.) en una tabla propia, separada del conteo de visitantes "
"humanos."

#: assets/src/js/admin/components/SettingsPanel.js:276
msgid ""
"Disabled by default: it adds a write on every request from these bots, which"
" is not negligible on a site with heavy crawler traffic."
msgstr ""
"Desactivado por defecto: añade una escritura en cada petición de estos bots,"
" lo que no es despreciable en un sitio con mucho tráfico de crawlers."

#: assets/src/js/admin/components/SettingsPanel.js:293
msgid ""
"Respect the browser's \"Do Not Track\" (DNT) and Global Privacy Control "
"(Sec-GPC) signal."
msgstr ""
"Respetar la señal \"No rastrear\" (DNT) y Global Privacy Control (Sec-GPC) "
"del navegador."

#: assets/src/js/admin/components/SettingsPanel.js:299
msgid ""
"The view count stays the same (it is already anonymous, with no IP or user "
"agent stored): this option only omits the device and referrer for that "
"visit."
msgstr ""
"El conteo de vistas se mantiene igual (ya es anónimo, sin IP ni user-agent "
"almacenados): esta opción solo omite el dispositivo y la procedencia de esa "
"visita."

#: assets/src/js/admin/components/SettingsPanel.js:309
msgid "Performance & retention"
msgstr "Rendimiento y retención"

#: assets/src/js/admin/components/SettingsPanel.js:313
msgid "Database writes and daily history."
msgstr "Escrituras en base de datos e histórico diario."

#: assets/src/js/admin/components/SettingsPanel.js:329
msgid ""
"Accumulate increments in memory and write them to the database in batches, "
"once per minute, instead of on every visit."
msgstr ""
"Acumular incrementos en memoria y escribirlos en la base de datos por lotes,"
" cada minuto, en vez de en cada visita."

#: assets/src/js/admin/components/SettingsPanel.js:336
msgid ""
"This site has a persistent object cache active: the buffer will take effect."
msgstr ""
"Este sitio tiene un object cache persistente activo: el buffer tendrá "
"efecto."

#: assets/src/js/admin/components/SettingsPanel.js:340
msgid ""
"This site has no persistent object cache (Redis, Memcached…) active: without"
" one, this option has no effect — each visit is still written immediately."
msgstr ""
"Este sitio no tiene un object cache persistente (Redis, Memcached…) activo: "
"sin uno, esta opción no tiene ningún efecto — cada visita se sigue "
"escribiendo de inmediato."

#: assets/src/js/admin/components/SettingsPanel.js:352
msgid "Daily aggregate retention"
msgstr "Retención del agregado diario"

#: assets/src/js/admin/components/SettingsPanel.js:371
msgid "days"
msgstr "días"

#: assets/src/js/admin/components/SettingsPanel.js:374
msgid ""
"This only affects how many days of daily history are shown for each content "
"item, not the total: you will only have history for that many days. The "
"total view count is unaffected and is never deleted by this retention."
msgstr ""
"Solo afecta a mostrar los datos diarios de cada contenido, no al total: solo"
" dispondrás del historial de esos días. El total de vistas no se ve afectado"
" y nunca se borra por esta retención."

#: assets/src/js/admin/components/SettingsPanel.js:387
msgid "Save settings"
msgstr "Guardar ajustes"

#: assets/src/js/admin/components/SettingsPanel.js:388
msgid "Saving…"
msgstr "Guardando…"

#: assets/src/js/admin/components/SettingsPanel.js:389
msgid "Discard changes"
msgstr "Descartar cambios"

#: assets/src/js/admin/components/SettingsPanel.js:395
msgid "Delete all data"
msgstr "Eliminar todos los datos"

#: assets/src/js/admin/components/SettingsPanel.js:396
msgid ""
"Immediately deletes all recorded views (own tables and post meta). This "
"action cannot be undone."
msgstr ""
"Elimina inmediatamente todas las vistas registradas (tablas propias y post "
"meta). Esta acción no se puede deshacer."

#: assets/src/js/admin/components/SettingsPanel.js:418
msgid "Delete all plugin tables, meta, and options on uninstall."
msgstr ""
"Eliminar todas las tablas, meta y opciones del plugin al desinstalarlo."

#: assets/src/js/admin/components/SettingsPanel.js:434
msgid "Deleting…"
msgstr "Eliminando…"

#: assets/src/js/admin/components/SettingsPanel.js:435
msgid "Delete all data now"
msgstr "Eliminar todos los datos ahora"

